Market Coverage

The platform analyzes five European electricity markets:

Country	Market Area
Germany	DE-LU
France	FR
Italy	IT
Netherlands	NL
Spain	ES

Analysis period:

2020 - 2026

System Architecture

The project follows a modular data analytics architecture:

Data Sources
     |
     ↓
Data Ingestion Layer
     |
     ↓
Data Validation
     |
     ↓
Feature Engineering
     |
     ↓
Forecasting Models
     |
     ↓
Risk Analytics
     |
     ↓
Interactive Dashboard
Data Pipeline

The platform includes automated refresh capabilities through an incremental pipeline.

Pipeline steps:

Generation data update
Load data update
Price data update
Imbalance calculation
Generation feature engineering
Market feature engineering
Risk feature engineering
Machine learning forecasting

The refresh process can be executed through:

python src/pipeline/refresh_pipeline.py
